This repository mixes original code with data and imagery derived from
third-party sources, and they carry different terms:

1. ORIGINAL CODE AND SITE CONTENT — the HTML/JS/CSS tools, build and data
   scripts, worker, and site chrome — are licensed under the MIT License
   below.

2. GAME DATA derived from the Old School RuneScape Wiki
   (https://oldschool.runescape.wiki) — including
   public/tools/runescape/data/naval/naval.json and navcells.png — is a
   derivative of wiki content and is licensed under the Creative Commons
   Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 3.0 license (CC BY-NC-SA 3.0,
   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/3.0/), the same license
   as its source. See https://meta.weirdgloop.org/w/Licensing.

3. GAME IMAGERY AND OTHER GAME MATERIAL — including
   public/tools/runescape/data/naval/map.jpg (rendered from the game's
   world map) — remains the intellectual property of its owners and is NOT
   covered by the MIT License. RuneScape and Old School RuneScape are
   trademarks of Jagex Limited; game material is used non-commercially
   under the terms of Jagex's Fan Content Policy
   (https://legal.jagex.com/docs/policies/fan-content-policy). World of
   Warcraft is a trademark of Blizzard Entertainment, Inc.; the World Map's
   map art and the data derived from the game client
   (public/tools/wow-forever/data/) are Blizzard's property, used
