   belongs to their respective owners. This
   project is not endorsed by or affiliated with Jagex or any other game
   publisher.

4. SKY DATA — public/tools/irl/data/sky-pointer/sky.json is built from the
   data files of d3-celestial (https://github.com/ofrohn/d3-celestial),
   Copyright (c) 2015, Olaf Frohn, licensed under the BSD 3-Clause License
   (the full notice is carried in the file's "license" field), together
   with the public-domain WMM2025 coefficients of NOAA/NCEI.

5. VANILLA SERVER VALUES — two things under public/tools/wow-forever/data/
   are derived from the CMaNGOS classic-db
   (https://github.com/cmangos/classic-db), which is licensed under the GNU
   General Public License, version 3
   (https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html): the positions of the vanilla
   bankers, auctioneers and flight masters in world-map/world-map.json, and
   the vanilla trainer skill levels in professions/professions.json (the
   recipes whose "s" field is "t" or "e"). They are credited to the CMaNGOS
   project and, so far as they are that project's to license, they remain
   under the GPLv3 and are NOT covered by the MIT License. The game data
   they describe is Blizzard's, as in section 3.

